    "projectDescriptionEn": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The company plans to open six new branches in 2016; four in Saudi Arabia and two in Kuwait. The openings expands the company&#39;s network to 46 branches in Saudi Arabia and abroad.</p>\r\n",
